br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241500196182743.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We started selling pump in 1990s and set up our company in 1998 by Mr. Chen. Nowadays our products are used by people in many countries, which makes us more confident in making pumps. 6'' electric submersible motor is one of our major products.</p><p><strong>1. Products Description</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor name</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Protection grade</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Speed</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Length</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">6PDm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP68</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2850rpm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">706mm-821mm<br/>706mm-1136mm</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor Casing</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Insulation class</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Oil filled type</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Well Diameter</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless AISI 304</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">F</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Oil filled</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">150mm(6&amp;rdquo;)</p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p>Single phase<br/>220V-240V~50Hz</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3-7.5kW</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Three phase<br/>380V-415V~50Hz</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3-22kW</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4-10HP</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4-30HP</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Chart</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241502102036439.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><img src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241500161893938.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\" title=\"image003(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241502138239158.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Production Application</strong></p><p>Electric submersible multistage pumps for raising clean water from wells,primary water supplying tanks and reservoirs 4ST series are in radial floating impellers.</p><p>For water supply from wells or reservoirs</p><p>For civil and industrial use</p><p>For agricultural supply and irrigation</p><p><strong>5. Our Service</strong></p><p><strong>Pre-sale service:</strong></p><p>1. Free of making offers, craft and technical guidance timely.</p><p>2. We can also make customized products according to your needs.</p><p>3. Customized design is available.</p><p><strong>After-sale service:</strong></p><p>1. We provide you with long-term after-sale service..</p><p>2. Just call or e-mail us to consult any relevant questions since we have a special line of after-sale service which will be available all day. Or you can communicate online with our salesman and solve the problems.</p><p>3. We will send many news styles in every week to our old customers.</p><p><strong>6. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411154549302.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411169751193.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>We have many certificates to guarantee the quality of our products. So customers could rest assured that our pumps could function well no matter in what proper conditions.</p><p><strong>7. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How to ship your goods? What is your most commonly used port?</strong></p><p>A: We can ship goods to you by sea, by air and by express. The ports of Ningbo, Shanghai and Lianyugang are our nearest seaport.</p><p><strong>2. Q: Could you provide samples?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, of course. We will send samples to you against advance deposit, but you are required to pay the price of sample pump and the freight charge.</p><p><strong>3. Q: How about product problem solution?</strong></p><p>A: We offer the spare parts of the product for replacement to you. And if you can’t solve the problem in your local, please mail the product to us, we will repair it and send it back to you.</p><p><strong>4. 1. Q: How long is the warranty of your company’s products?</strong></p><p>A: 1 year usually.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"products